  "title": "Displacement Confirmation Added to Sweeps",
  "bootstrap_reps": 10000,
  "bootstrap_seed": 42,
  "definition": "After each EXP-015 failed sweep, the first candle within 10 bars whose body is at least 1.5 times the prior 100-bar median absolute body and whose close is in the directional quartile confirms displacement.",
